      "content": "i get that, but look... i checked the logs again. it's only like 0.5% above the threshold. the sensors have been a bit glitchy lately with the temperature swings on those high-altitude legs. u sure it's a real trend and not just some sensor noise or environmental interference? id rather not pull a plane out of service for a ghost reading if we don't have to.",
